<main id="content" class="site-main post mt-article"><div class="page-header"><h1 class="entry-title">8 Ways How Indoor Water Displays Revolutionize the Mall Experience</h1></div><div class="page-content"><p class="mt-article-meta"><time datetime="2023-07-28T14:37:00">July 28, 2023</time></p><figure class="mt-article-hero"><img src="/wp-content/uploads/ALTER-22.jpg" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/ALTER-22-800x627.jpg 800w, /wp-content/uploads/ALTER-22-100x100.jpg 100w, /wp-content/uploads/ALTER-22-768x602.jpg 768w, /wp-content/uploads/ALTER-22.jpg 600w, /wp-content/uploads/ALTER-22-150x118.jpg 150w, /wp-content/uploads/ALTER-22-300x235.jpg 300w, /wp-content/uploads/ALTER-22-380x298.jpg 380w, /wp-content/uploads/ALTER-22-480x376.jpg 480w, /wp-content/uploads/ALTER-22-640x502.jpg 640w, /wp-content/uploads/ALTER-22-768x602.jpg 768w, /wp-content/uploads/ALTER-22-1024x803.jpg 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/ALTER-22.jpg 1195w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 860px" width="1195" height="937" alt="8 Ways How Indoor Water Displays Revolutionize the Mall Experience" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"></figure><div class="mt-article-body">
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Malls, often bustling with laughter, chatter and occasional cries of toddlers, are more than just shopping destinations. They are social gathering hubs, meeting points, unwinding spaces, and showcases of retail innovation. In the race to become people&#8217;s favorite places, malls have used a transformative secret weapon: indoor water features. These features might not seem a big addition, but they breathe life into the mall, making every visit an exciting experience.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">There are 8 ways in which water features improve the whole mall experience.</p>



<h6 class="wp-block-heading">1.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Aquatic Grandeur</h6>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">People have favorite malls. Consider walking through its entrance; the first thing people encounter is a stunning water feature. It turns heads, whether a <a href="/materials/glass-water-features/" data-type="link" data-id="https://www.midwest-tropical.com/materials/glass-water-features/">glass waterfall wall</a> or a tranquil reflecting fountain. This is the essence of what indoor water features bring to malls: an immediate sense of grandeur and spectacle.</p>



<h6 class="wp-block-heading">2.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; The Thrill of Discovery</h6>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">These features are not mere decorations; they&#8217;re attractions in themselves. People might be strolling past a whimsical, choreographed water show or watching colorful fish glide through a labyrinthine aquarium. Malls are turning into recreational places rather than just shopping centers.</p>



<h6 class="wp-block-heading">3.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Soundscapes of Tranquility</h6>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Imagine stepping into a mall and being greeted by the soothing sounds of&nbsp;<a href="/materials/glass-water-features/">water bubble walls</a>.&nbsp;These gentle murmurs offer a serene contrast to the urban clamor outside. The result? A sense of relaxation that makes shopping or leisure strolling more enjoyable</p>



<h6 class="wp-block-heading">4.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Natural Respite</h6>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Malls are often architectural marvels, but they can sometimes feel cold and impersonal. These water features add an element of nature to a closed environment. Ponds with aquatic plants or cascading waterfalls surrounded by greenery create a respite from the hustle and bustle. It&#8217;s like a touch of the great outdoors right in the heart of the mall.</p>



<h6 class="wp-block-heading">5.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Instagrammable Moments</h6>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">In the time of social media, malls have become the backdrop for countless selfies and Instagram posts. Water features are the perfect background for this trend. Malls are transforming into picturesque settings where every corner is an Instagrammable moment waiting to happen.</p>



<h6 class="wp-block-heading">6.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Community Hubs</h6>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Malls aren&#8217;t just for shopping anymore; they are gathering places for communities to encourage people to meet, chat, and relax in their midst. Whether it&#8217;s friends catching up by a fountain or families sharing stories near a bubbling water wall, these aquatic elements bring a sense of togetherness.</p>



<h6 class="wp-block-heading">7.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Improved Retail Therapy</h6>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Shopping isn&#8217;t just about buying and buying stuff; it&#8217;s also about unwinding. And people can unwind better when a soothing sound comes when they walk around, soaking all the positivity from the mall.</p>



<h6 class="wp-block-heading">8.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Environmental Harmony</h6>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Beyond their aesthetic appeal, indoor water features have practical benefits for the mall environment. They help improve the overall comfort of the mall. Some malls also use reclaimed water for water features, contributing to sustainability efforts. They also keep the humidity in check since the AC is running 24/7.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">These were the 8 ways in which a thing like a water feature can improve the mall experience, and this is why every mall designer and owner should consider adding it in their commercial setting.</p>



